WEBVTT

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:10.036
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:10.286 --> 00:00:15.703
Select Life Skills from Category.

00:00:15.953 --> 00:00:21.277
Tick Select Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:26.475
Tick Select Staying Safe Online.

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:31.115
Click Set maturity rating.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:36.593
Select PG from Maturity rating.

00:00:36.843 --> 00:00:42.843
Click Apply.

00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:49.761
Choose Series in the side menu.

00:00:50.011 --> 00:00:55.990
Click Maths Made Simple
to open the series.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:02.240
Select G from Maturity rating (required).

00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:08.659
Click Save changes.

00:01:12.785 --> 00:01:17.544
Click Apply to all 2 episodes.

00:01:17.794 --> 00:01:23.794
Click Apply to 2 episodes.
